                            <p class="mb-2"><strong>The two scenarios:</strong></p>
                            <ul class="mb-0">
                                <li><strong>Restoring from backup</strong> &rarr; Run <code>pg_restore</code>. Tables + data are created automatically. <span class="text-success">No migrations needed.</span></li>
                                <li><strong>Fresh install (no backup)</strong> &rarr; Run <code>setup.bat</code> (included in the project). It runs migrations to create empty tables and seeds a default admin account.</li>
